{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達的總法律顧問介入了美國政府對Megaspeed International涉嫌走私AI晶片的調查，詢問特朗普政府是否參與扣留這家新加坡公司的一名高管。這位高管如今成為一起威脅黃仁勳的醜聞事件的核心人物。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585672.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.295821+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T22:59:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"1b176258b75c2fe92785120c08c32346f5c2a6f1c762498c85d473903b0c2366","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}